        <text>Hi,

{!CaseRecord.Case_Creator__c} has raised a Sales Offer Case for Corporate Trigger - 50% Bonus Status in Salesforce.

Case Number: {!CaseRecord.CaseNumber}
Account Name: {!CaseRecord.Account.Name}
Campaign Start Date: {!CaseRecord.Campaign_Start_Date__c}
Campaign End Date: {!CaseRecord.Campaign_End_Date__c}
